%% oneway 异步调用时序
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client 线程
    participant K as 内核
    participant S as Server 线程

    C->>K: ioctl(BC_TRANSACTION, TF_ONE_WAY)
    K->>K: 投递到 Server 线程 todo<br/>或 node->async_todo
    K-->>C: BR_TRANSACTION_COMPLETE
    Note over C: 立即返回, 不等结果
    Note over C: 继续执行其它逻辑

    Note over K,S: 稍后...
    K->>S: 唤醒, BR_TRANSACTION
    S->>S: 执行实现
    Note over S: 不发送 BC_REPLY
